       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CORTADO.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-NOME                 PIC X(22).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           MOVE "MARIA APARECIDA SANTOS" TO WS-NOME
           PERFORM 1000-TESTAR
           MOVE "ANA LUCIA FERREIRA" TO WS-NOME
           PERFORM 1000-TESTAR
           GOBACK.
       1000-TESTAR.
           IF WS-NOME(22:1) NOT = SPACE
               DISPLAY WS-NOME " - PROVAVELMENTE CORTADO"
           ELSE
               DISPLAY WS-NOME " - OK"
           END-IF.
